WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Focus the KeyMove search bar.

00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
Type just “cof” to match “coffee” on the page. The whole word is not needed.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Press Tab to select the next matching text block. Press it again to keep moving.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
Press Escape to close the search.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000
Focus the KeyMove search bar again.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.000
Switch to action mode.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Type “Save this guide” to find the button.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Press Enter to activate the button. The guide is saved.

00:28.000 --> 00:29.000
Focus KeyMove again to find a link.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.000
Type “Open the checklist”.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.000
Press Arrow Down to open the selected result’s action menu.

00:37.000 --> 00:38.000
Press Escape to close the menu and keep your query.

00:38.000 --> 00:46.000
Hover over ? to show the keyboard shortcut reference.
